CrossOver Preview 20261015 / Wine 11.17: narrowly port CNG PFX import.
The old CrossOver 26.3 patch has 22 hunks spread over six files, but this
Wine 11.17 version already implements certificate NCRYPT properties and
PFXExportCertStoreEx. Do not overwrite those newer implementations.
Only provide PKCS12_ALWAYS_CNG_KSP support in PFXImportCertStore, importing
the CAPI RSA private blob into NCrypt and attaching it to a matching cert.
Experimental: source hunk matching is not a successful build or launcher test.

